        "notes": "This game contains themes of psychological horror, loss, death, and trauma. Certain scenes depict fire, emotional breakdowns, disturbing flashbacks, and intense dialogue.\r\n\r\nWhile there is no direct depiction of physical violence, the story involves tragic deaths, missing children, and encounters with supernatural entities as a result of past events.\r\n\r\nThe game also explores depression, loneliness, and guilt, which may be emotionally triggering for some players.\r\n\r\nThere are no scenes of sexual content, sexual assault, drug use, or alcohol consumption in this game."
